 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 12523,
   "ANSWER": "<ul>\n\t<li data-end=\"2084\" data-start=\"2009\">\n\t<p data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"550\">When a requested page is not in memory (i.e., <strong data-end=\"635\" data-start=\"612\">a page fault occurs</strong>) and no free frame is available, the OS must <strong data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"681\">select a page to remove</strong> to make space. A <strong data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"726\">page replacement algorithm</strong> decides <strong data-end=\"790\" data-start=\"765\">which page to replace</strong> to minimize future faults and improve efficiency.</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"867\" data-start=\"842\">\ud83d\udcca <strong data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"845\">Mark Allocation:</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"868\">\n\t<p data-end=\"896\" data-start=\"870\">Page fault context &ndash; 40%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"897\">\n\t<p data-end=\"929\" data-start=\"899\">Purpose of replacement &ndash; 40%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"930\">\n\t<p data-end=\"979\" data-start=\"932\">Mention of efficiency &ndash; 20%</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"1993\">What is the need for a page replacement algorithm?</h3>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 407,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 12523
  },
  {
   "_id": 12524,
   "ANSWER": "<ul>\n\t<li data-end=\"2084\" data-start=\"2009\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1742\" data-start=\"1494\"><strong data-end=\"1521\" data-start=\"1510\">Optimal</strong> replacement replaces the page that will <strong data-end=\"1612\" data-start=\"1562\">not be used for the longest time in the future</strong>. It gives the <strong data-end=\"1659\" data-start=\"1627\">lowest number of page faults</strong>, but is not practical because it requires <strong data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1702\">future knowledge</strong> of page references.</p>\n\n\t<p data-end=\"1769\" data-start=\"1744\"><strong data-end=\"1767\" data-start=\"1747\">Mark Allocation:</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1795\" data-start=\"1770\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1795\" data-start=\"1772\">Algorithm logic &ndash; 50%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1829\" data-start=\"1796\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1829\" data-start=\"1798\">Example of &ldquo;future use&rdquo; &ndash; 30%</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1883\" data-start=\"1830\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1883\" data-start=\"1832\">Reason for impracticality &ndash; 20%<br data-end=\"1866\" data-start=\"1863\" />\n\t&nbsp;</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO2"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<h3 data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"1993\">Describe the Optimal page replacement algorithm. Why is it not used in practice?</h3>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 407,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 12524
  }
 ],
